>>__ load "simpExtLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `remove_solver`

``` hol4
simpExtLib.remove_solver : string -> simpExtLib.simpset -> simpExtLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Removes all solvers of the given name from both safe and unsafe lists.

### Failure

Never fails. Missing names leave the set unchanged.

### Example

``` hol4
>>_ val ext_bool_ss = simpExtLib.lift_simpset boolSimps.bool_ss;
>>_ val ss = simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver
     (simpExtLib.mk_tactic_solver ("decide", DECIDE_TAC))
     ext_bool_ss;
>>_ val without_decide = simpExtLib.remove_solver "decide" ss;
```

### See also

[`simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpExtLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpExtLib.add_safe_solver).
